    <div class="update-content"><p><del>NKAS at static@552965 is currently incomplete for data (stages and whatnot). Viewer should be fine though. If the static version isn&#39;t at 552965, you can safely ignore this log.</del></p>
<p><del>It will take a while longer than usual when I&#39;ll update for this. I apologize for the inconvenience!</del></p>
