    <div class="update-entry">
    <p class="update-date">07-23-2026</p>
    <div class="update-content"><p><strong>Viewer</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>Improvements to Copy as Link -- added the ability to share everything in the lists as links.</p>
</li>
<li><p>You can now see the full name of the model when its truncated simply by hovering over it in the list.</p>
</li>
<li><p>Improvements to layout shifts. Should be smoother now.</p>
</li>
<li><p>Treasure models now work consistently, even with asynchronous animations.</p>
<ul>
<li><p>The animation list will now be hidden for two animations, Idle and Tap. That way, you don&#39;t have to set individual animation for each extra model.</p>
</li>
<li><p>You can now scrub the timeline properly for treasures with asynchronous animations like Helm and Miranda.</p>
</li>
<li><p>While this was somewhat thoroughly tested, I may have forgotten a foreground or two. Please let me know if issues arise!</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p>I accidentally pushed to the main NKAS website first before the L2D storage was done. Sorry!</p>
</div>
