    <div class="update-entry">
    <p class="update-date">11-21-2025</p>
    <div class="update-content"><p>Added <strong>CURATED ALBUMS</strong>!<br></p>
<ul>
<li><p><a href="https://nkas.pages.dev/jukebox/?a=99999990"><strong>BOSS RUSH</strong></a> - Should be all of the Boss tracks? Most of them should be there.</p>
</li>
<li><p><a href="https://nkas.pages.dev/jukebox/?a=99999991"><strong>FOREVER HALCYON</strong></a> - Mostly delightful tracks, either happy, joyous, or chill.</p>
</li>
<li><p><a href="https://nkas.pages.dev/jukebox/?a=99999992"><strong>TORN SOUL</strong></a> - Tracks that may have or may have not made me cry at times.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>These are some songs I listen to on the daily that I just clumped together in an album.<br></p>
<p>If you have a suggestion, and is able to contact me in some kind of way, don&#39;t hesitate to let me know.</p>
<p><em>oh yeah, I&#39;ll also add more albums, what&#39;s coming next is Battle Mixes!</em></p>
</div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="update-entry">
    <p class="update-date">11-20-2025</p>
    <div class="update-content"><p>Apparently, the Beastiary had some issues on compile time, getting the wrong data when building the page.<br></p>
<p>I also had errors with my parser, taking in &quot;summoned&quot; Raptures rather than actual on-field Raptures.</p>
<p>Thanks to MochiNekoRyu from Discord for pointing this out!</p>
</div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="update-entry">
    <p class="update-date">11-04-2025</p>
    <div class="update-content"><p><strong>L2D Viewer -&gt; Viewer</strong><br></p>
<p>Let me address the somewhat weirdly shaped elephant in the room.</p>
<p>The game does not use <a href="https://www.live2d.com/en/">Live2D Cubism</a>. It uses <a href="https://esotericsoftware.com/">Spine</a>. The game using Live 2D is such a common misconception I just decided to use the term. But it kind of hurts.</p>
<p>So the &quot;L2D Viewer&quot; has been renamed to just &quot;<a href="/viewer/">Viewer</a>.&quot; &quot;Spine Viewer&quot; doesn&#39;t really roll off the tongue does it?</p>
<br>

<p><strong>Jukebox (ALPHA)</strong><br></p>
<p>I introduce: the Jukebox!</p>
<p>Right now, it&#39;s barely functional. But I plan to add things like playlists, history, and all that soon.</p>
<p><em>This has been available in the dev branch for a long time... Though, this branch will be retired.</em></p>
</div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="update-entry">
    <p class="update-date">08-14-2025</p>
    <div class="update-content"><p><strong>Sunsetting Chinese Assets</strong></p>
<p>I have removed the Chinese assets due to really not being able to be updated. The whole thing is a storage hog, which leaves less for future content from Global. I&#39;m sorry, and I hope you understand where I&#39;m going with this.</p>
<p>Just hope someone in CN has the ability to store them on their own. Which honestly, given how the CN version is built, it&#39;s not impossible.</p>
</div>
    </div>
    
